[en.FOCUS_C12_CONFRONTATION_WITH_THE_EMPIRE]
Uninvited Guest

[en.FOCUS_C12_CONFRONTATION_WITH_THE_EMPIRE_desc]
Even though they are separated by thousands of miles, the three Pie sisters and Cozy Glow have engaged in a contest that will determine not only the fate of the entire farm but also that of all of Equestria. What direction will the future of the rock farm take?

[zh.FOCUS_C12_CONFRONTATION_WITH_THE_EMPIRE]
命运的冲突

[zh.FOCUS_C12_CONFRONTATION_WITH_THE_EMPIRE_desc]
纵然相隔了千里，派家三姐妹与可西光辉展开了一场事关整个农场乃至小马利亚命运的较量，采石农场的未来会通往何方？

